ae10cc3a1094b8dc34df4a03832b6e.apng?t=1771539726\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836070/extras/13ae10cc3a1094b8dc34df4a03832b6e.poster.avif?t=1771539726\" class=\"bb_img\" width=672 height=480 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make and upgrade your heroes' equipment using materials scavenged in raids and on gathering missions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the necessary tools needed to help your heroes out on their adventures, such as potions, bombs and relics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the furniture needed to turn your guild from a shack to a castle fit for a hero of any calibre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836070/extras/aa9be68cf00d8760c7b913faee25f976.webp?t=1771539726\" width=631 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836070/extras/a64307102f5dc96602782da337c8d055.avif?t=1771539726\" width=631 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Of course, there's more to running a guild than just the heroes and finances\u2014there's the guild itself, too!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836070/extras/e7fea1313946c18c9566af0800e61d1d.apng?t=1771539726\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836070/extras/e7fea1313946c18c9566af0800e61d1d.poster.avif?t=1771539726\" class=\"bb_img\" width=672 height=480 /></picture></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your guild's living quarters with furniture that has been bought, found and crafted. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your guild's reputation to attract more guest merchants and services with stringent housing requirements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build more rooms to improve the quality of life for your heroes, and unlock some upgrades at the same time. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836070/extras/aa9be68cf00d8760c7b913faee25f976.webp?t=1771539726\" width=631 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, there's always room to grow and expand your guild! So... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836070/extras/e85c3c1fd041fe502a111062143fe146.avif?t=1771539726\" width=631 height=64 /></span></p>","developers":["Untouch"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836070/b62b01481a460abb64a159983dd9f3fb7e9e239a/header.jpg?t=1771539726","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2836070/986149949/8497ea27249d5ef64cef7f827c6acf686ee7fdc1/1751389326/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751390624","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2836070/986149949/8497ea27249d5ef64cef7f827c6acf686ee7fdc1/1751389326/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751390624","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2836070/986149949/8497ea27249d5ef64cef7f827c6acf686ee7fdc1/1751389326/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751390624","id":257163958,"name":"EA_Trailer_Smaller","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto